{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "ff1eb04e-0a82-8597-9714-8459d9fa28a2",
  "created_at": "2025-12-10T09:08:01-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Jorge Costa",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T09:06:23-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T09:06:27-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, good morning. Yeah, I'm calling about a dip in the road, you know, where they dug a trench for a utility line. I mean, it was patched, but it's settled and now there's a real dip."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T09:06:38-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, a settled utility trench. Where is this?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T09:06:41-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "442 Dean Avenue. Right in front of the house, more or less. Dean Avenue, in the Fifth Ward, right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T09:06:47-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, got it. 442 Dean. So the patch has sunk down and left a dip. About how deep, would you say?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T09:06:53-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, I'd say a few inches, you know, in the middle. Enough that you feel it. My neighbor hit it too, I mean, he came over and said it rattled his whole truck."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T09:07:02-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ouch. Okay, I'm putting down that a neighbor's vehicle hit it as well. Is it in the travel lane, or off to the side?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T09:07:09-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's in the lane, right. Yeah. Kind of toward the middle of the lane."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T09:07:14-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. I'll put in the request for a crew to look at it. Anything else on it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T09:07:19-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, one thing. How long does it usually take, you know, for something like that to get repaired? I mean, roughly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T09:07:25-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Usually a couple of weeks for a patch like this, sometimes sooner. Winter can stretch it, since the asphalt plants slow down and the weather has to cooperate."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T09:07:33-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, right. Okay. I only ask because, you know, my grandson's doing a science fair project, a volcano with the baking soda, and I was gonna drive it over Friday. I don't want it sloshing around in the back seat going over that dip."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T09:07:45-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, you don't want a volcano erupting early. Go slow over it and you'll be fine. Do you want a callback number on the request?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T09:07:52-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, it's 401-555-0183. You follow me on that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T09:07:55-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0183. Jorge Costa, 442 Dean Avenue, settled trench. You're all set."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T09:07:59-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, thank you. Appreciate it."
    }
  ],
